        "status": "Ended",
        "episodes": [
            {
                "season_number": 4,
                "episode_number": 8,
                "title": "The Hashira Unite",
                "air_date": "2024-06-30",
                "airtime": "20:15",
                "air_datetime": "2024-06-30T14:15:00+00:00",
                "overview": "During a silent night when the moon shines, Kagaya finally meets Muzan Kibutsuji, who appears at the Ubuyashiki Mansion. Kagaya is staying alive day-by-day through his steadfast desire to defeat Muzan, while Muzan dreams of eternity. What will these two, bound by a continuous thousand-year fate, talk about?",
