                "overview": "Amid the wreckage from the buildings destroyed by the destructive attacks of Daki's Belt, Tanjiro awakens. Zenitsu is trapped under the rubble and Inosuke has been impaled by Gyutaro's scythe, while Uzui has lost an arm and his heart has stopped. As Gyutaro taunts Tanjiro by calling him a disgrace, all seems hopeless until...",
