                "air_datetime": "2021-12-12T14:15:00+00:00",
                "overview": "One day, Tanjiro\u00a0returns to the Butterfly Mansion and finds Sound Hashira, Tengen Uzui, attempting to take Aoi and Naho away on a mission against their will. Tanjiro, Zenitsu and Inosuke offer to go on that mission instead, and they head to their next destination - the Entertainment District.",
