                "air_datetime": "2021-11-28T14:15:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Akaza continues to offer Rengoku the chance to become a demon to improve his skills. Rengoku refuses his offer and is trying his best to keep up with him. The fire Hashira has one goal:to protect his comrades even if it costs his own life.",
