        "title": "The Wheel of Time",
        "year": "2021",
        "overview": "The lives of five young villagers change forever when a strange and powerful woman arrives, claiming one of them is the child of an ancient prophecy with the power to tip the balance between Light and Dark forever. They must choose whether to trust this stranger \u2013 and each other \u2013 with the fate of the world before the Dark One breaks out of His prison, and the Last Battle begins.",
        "cover_image": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ihBi24EIr5kwAeY2PqmsgAcCj4n.jpg",
