                "overview": "Moiraine and Lan find help in an unexpected \u2013 and unwanted \u2013 quarter, as the separated villagers try to find their way back to each other, or at least to refuge. But they all soon learn how far the Dark One's reach extends, and how few they can trust on the road.",
