                "overview": "Calling all God U #Hometeamers! Today we're protesting Socialist Victoria Neuman's town hall on campus! Let's show Neuman and her Supe-hating woke mob that we won't put up with their anti-Superhero agenda! THEY WILL NOT CONTROL US! #MakeAmericaSuperAgain #SupeLivesMatter",
