                "airtime": "18:00",
                "air_datetime": "2023-10-06T12:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "The Godolkin University Police Department is seeking any information on the person or persons who violated the Polarity statue in the groin/genital area last night outside the School of Crimefighting. If you have any information, please contact @GodUPD.",
