                "title": "First Day",
                "air_date": "2023-09-29",
                "airtime": "18:00",
                "air_datetime": "2023-09-29T12:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "The Godolkin University Mental Health Hotline would like to remind students at this difficult time that you are not alone. You might be bulletproof on the outside, but you're not on the inside. Our caring staff is trained to deal with the specific emotional needs of superheroes and they're here to help you. If you need to talk to someone, help is just a phone call or vMessage away. #GodUCares",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/479/1197665.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 2600242,
                "id": 2,
