                "airtime": "19:00",
                "air_datetime": "2019-07-05T13:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Thousands of years after a mysterious phenomenon turned all of humanity to stone, the super-intelligent, science-driven boy Senku Ishigami awakens. Facing a world of stone and the total collapse of civilization, Senku decides to use science to rebuild the world. Together with his childhood friend Taiju Oki, they begin to rebuild civilization from scratch.",
