                "overview": "In the desperate search for Melody Pond, the Tardis crash lands in 1930s Berlin, bringing the Doctor face-to-face with the greatest war criminal in the Universe. And Hitler. The Doctor must teach his adversaries that time travel has responsibilities\u2014and in so doing, learns a harsh lesson in the cruelest warfare of all.",
