                "air_date": "2026-11-27",
                "airtime": "07:00",
                "air_datetime": "2026-11-28T01:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Kevin Owens joins forces with Finn B\u00e1lor against Gunther and Undisputed WWE Champion Sami Zayn in an explosive tag team showdown.Irate over Captain Cody Rhodes' decision to add Seth Rollins to Team USA on Raw, CM Punk is set to kick off SmackDown, just one day before their match against Team Mexico in a Traditional Elimination Match at Survivor Series: WarGames.Danhausen is giving some very nice, very evil thanks for all that SmackDown has given him. Experience all the outrageous moments from Danhausen's Friendsgiving Party.Alexa Bliss &amp; Tatum Paxley challenge WWE Women's Tag Team Champions Michin and B-Fab in an explosive title rematch, one night before the Women's WarGames Match at Survivor Series.\u00a0After a backstage altercation last week, Chelsea Green goes one-on-one with Blake Monroe.",
