                "air_date": "2026-11-20",
                "airtime": "07:00",
                "air_datetime": "2026-11-21T01:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "At Survivor Series, Charlotte Flair, Stephanie Vaquer, Alexa Bliss, Tatum Paxley and Bayley will battle Fatal Influence, Jade Cargill and Michin in a WarGames Match. En route to the career-altering showdown, The Queen will take on The Storm to determine which team will get the WarGames advantage.\u00a0Following comments from Damian Priest questioning whether United States Champion Trick Williams deserves the opportunities he has been receiving, the two Superstars will go one-on-one in a non-title match.Last week, The War Raiders interrupted The MFTs' WWE Tag Team Championship Match against Bakusai with a brutal attack.\u00a0Tonight, Shinsuke Nakamura and Kyoki will be out for retribution against Erik and Ivar in an explosive tag team showdown.",
