                "air_datetime": "2026-11-14T01:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "After traveling to Raw and NXT, John Cena is set to journey to Friday Night SmackDown to invite more Superstars to the John Cena Classic, airing from Disney's ESPN Wide World of Sports Complex on Monday, Dec. 14.After betraying her friend Chelsea Green at WWE Crown Jewel and successfully cashing in her Money in the Bank contract for the second year in a row, Tiffany Stratton returns to SmackDown as\u00a0the new WWE Women's Champion.",
