                "air_datetime": "2026-10-03T00:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Cody Rhodes, Kevin Owens and Johnny Gargano are set to collide in a Triple Threat Money in the Bank Qualifying Match.\u00a0Tatum Paxley, Tiffany Stratton and Candice LeRae will battle in a Triple Threat Money in the Bank Qualifying Match.\u00a0Who will complete the field in the Women's Money in the Bank Ladder Match?\u00a0After months of backstage assaults and \"almost\" matches, Blake Monroe will at last make her SmackDown in-ring debut against archrival Giulia. The two Superstars have been at odds since Monroe arrived on SmackDown a few months ago.",
