                "overview": "Trick Williams will defend the United States Championship against Baron Corbin in a Steel Cage Match.\u00a0CM Punk, Finn B\u00e1lor and Gunther will lock horns in a can't-miss Triple Threat Money in the Bank Qualifying Match.Charlotte Flair, Giulia and Lash Legend of The Irresistible Forces will square off in a Triple Threat Money in the Bank Qualifying Match.WWE Women's Champion Chelsea Green, Tiffany Stratton and Paige join forces to take on Women's United States Champion Jacy Jayne and WWE Women's Tag Team Champions Fallon Henley and Lainey Reid in a turbulent Six-Woman Tag Team Match.",
