            {
                "season_number": 27,
                "episode_number": 38,
                "title": "#1411 - Hilliard Center in Corpus Christi, TX",
                "air_date": "2026-09-18",
                "airtime": "06:00",
                "air_datetime": "2026-09-19T00:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "In a flurry of chaos created by Kevin Owens, Johnny Gargano and Candice LeRae last week, Sami Zayn took advantage and defeated CM Punk to recapture the Undisputed WWE Championship.\u00a0The self-proclaimed \"Last Real Good Guy\" will be on SmackDown.\u00a0Cody Rhodes returns to SmackDown after losing a highly personal showdown against Randy Orton at Sunday Night's Main Event.",
