                "title": "#1406 - TD Garden in Boston, MA",
                "air_date": "2026-08-14",
                "airtime": "06:00",
                "air_datetime": "2026-08-15T00:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "With the tension at a fever pitch, will CM Punk and Kevin Owens come to blows one week before their Undisputed WWE Championship Match in Toronto?\u00a0 Don't miss all the action in Boston.After Randy Orton avoided a physical altercation with an irate Cody Rhodes last week and sparked an intense war of words, will The American Nightmare finally get his hands on the 14-time World Champion?Baron Corbin will go head-to-head with Carmelo Hayes for the U.S. Title in Melo's hometown of Boston.Tiffany Stratton will go through with the championship match against Jacy Jayne. Will it be Tiffy Time for the up-and-coming Jayne?\u00a0After a backstage altercation with Erik and Ivar last week, Priest and R-Truth will defend the WWE Tag Team Title in a Triple Threat Tag Team Match against The War Raiders and The MFTs. Find out who will walk out of Boston with the gold.",
