                "air_datetime": "2026-08-08T00:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "The path was long and arduous, but Kevin Owens stunned everyone by winning the Fatal 4-Way Match to become the No. 1 Contender to Undisputed WWE Champion CM Punk. How will Punk respond to KO's return and prepare for his next challenger?Despite all odds, Chelsea Green climbed the ladder to win the Interim WWE Women's Title at SummerSlam. Now that Green is champion, what are her plans for SmackDown?Bitter rivals Charlotte Flair and Jade Cargill will square off in a highly anticipated matchup.\u00a0Randy Orton made his shocking return at SummerSlam, striking Cody Rhodes with an RKO during The American Nightmare's title match against Undisputed WWE Champion CM Punk. How will Rhodes respond?",
