                "air_datetime": "2026-08-01T00:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "CM Punk and Cody Rhodes will come face to face one final time before their blockbuster Undisputed WWE Championship Match this weekend at SummerSlam.After accepting a challenge several weeks ago from AAA Tag Team Champion War Raiders, WWE Tag Team Champion Damian Priest &amp; R-Truth are set to put their title on the line against Erik and Ivar in what is sure to be an explosive tag team collision.\u00a0Tiffany Stratton, Jade Cargill, Charlotte Flair and Chelsea Green have all qualified for the WWE Interim Women's Championship Ladder Match at SummerSlam. Now, Giulia will square off against Lash Legend to determine\u00a0who will join the elite competition.",
