                "airtime": "06:00",
                "air_datetime": "2026-06-27T00:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "On the eve of their Triple Threat Match at WWE Night of Champions, Undisputed WWE Champion Cody Rhodes will address Gunther and Sami Zayn. What will The American Nightmare want to talk about on the night before the epic free-for-all?\u00a0After defeating Axiom a few weeks ago in his first title defense, Rey Fenix will bring the AAA Cruiserweight Championship back to SmackDown to battle Axiom's tag team partner Nathan Frazer.Trick Williams must now put his title on the line against Ricky Saints at WWE Night of Champions. How will Trick prepare for his dangerous opponent? Find out tonight.England's own Paige will go one-on-one with Fatal Influence's Jacy Jayne in Paige's first singles match since her return to action. Can one-half of the WWE Women's Tag Team Champions earn a home country win in England?\u00a0Former business associates Giulia and Kiana James will battle it out for the first time since their falling out.",
                "still_image": "",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 3616341,
                "id": 1401,
                "watched": true,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 27,
                "episode_number": 25,
                "title": "#1398 - T-Mobile Arena in Kansas City, MO",
                "air_date": "2026-06-19",
                "airtime": "06:00",
                "air_datetime": "2026-06-20T00:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Cody Rhodes is set to battle Gunther in a commercial-free Undisputed WWE Championship rematch.\u00a0What will happen in the turbulent title matchup?\u00a0Charlotte Flair is set to take on Women's World Champion Liv Morgan in the Queen of the Ring Tournament Semifinals.\u00a0The winner will clash with IYO SKY in the final at WWE Night of Champions for the crown and the opportunity to challenge a World Champion at SummerSlam.\u00a0\"Main Event\" Jey Uso is set to battle Je'Von Evans in the King of the Ring Tournament Semifinals.\u00a0The winner of the explosive showdown will take on Oba Femi in the final at WWE Night of Champions to earn the right to challenge a World Champion at SummerSlam.\u00a0Will Jey earn the right to compete in the King of the Ring Final on his own? Or is Night of Champions about to get bouncy?\u00a0WWE Tag Team Champions Damian Priest and R-Truth are set to defend the title against Talla Tonga and Tama Tonga.\u00a0Carmelo Hayes and Ricky Saints are about to write the next chapter in their heated rivalry when they battle to earn the right to challenge United States Champion Trick Williams at WWE Night of Champions.",
                "still_image": "",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 3567263,
                "id": 1400,
                "watched": true,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 27,
                "episode_number": 24,
                "title": "#1397 - Amica Mutual Pavilion in Providence, RI",
                "air_date": "2026-06-12",
                "airtime": "06:00",
                "air_datetime": "2026-06-13T00:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Gunther is once again coming for Undisputed WWE Champion Cody Rhodes.\u00a0What stipulation will The Ring General choose for his title showdown against The American Nightmare? How will Rhodes respond?Women's Intercontinental Champion Sol Ruca, Charlotte Flair, Lyra Valkyria and Jade Cargill\u00a0are set to battle in a Fatal 4-Way Queen of the Ring Tournament Match.\u00a0Women's Intercontinental Champion Sol Ruca, Charlotte Flair, Lyra Valkyria and Jade Cargill\u00a0are set to battle in a Fatal 4-Way Queen of the Ring Tournament Match. Who will seize the final first-round victory to advance to the Queen of the Ring Semifinals?\"Main Event\" Jey Uso, LA Knight, Finn B\u00e1lor and Royce Keys are set to go to war in a Fatal 4-Way King of the Ring Tournament Match.\u00a0Who will seize the final first-round victory and advance to the King of the Ring Semifinals?\u00a0WWE Women's Tag Team Champions Paige and Brie Bella step into the ring with the dangerous Fallon Henley and Lainey Reid of Fatal Influence in an exciting non-title match.",
                "still_image": "",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 3567262,
                "id": 1399,
                "watched": true,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 27,
                "episode_number": 23,
                "title": "#1396 - Unipol Arena in Bologna, Italy",
                "air_date": "2026-06-05",
                "airtime": "06:00",
                "air_datetime": "2026-06-06T00:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "After a successful but controversial title defense against Gunther at WWE Clash in Italy, Undisputed WWE Champion Cody Rhodes will find out what Bologna, Italy wants to talk about.After Rhea Ripley successfully defended the WWE Women's Championship against former titleholder Jade Cargill at WWE Clash in Italy, find out what's next for the champion.Bayley, Raquel Rodriguez, Jacy Jayne and Kiana James will mix it up in a Fatal 4-Way Queen of the Ring First-Round Match. Who will earn a crucial victory in the high-stakes tournament?WWE Tag Team Champion Damian Priest, United States Champion Trick Williams, World Tag Team Champion Bron Breakker and AAA Mega Champion Dominik Mysterio are set to battle in a Fatal 4-Way King of the Ring First-Round Match. Who will advance in the high-stakes tournament?After battling to a double count-out and brawling after the bell last week, Carmelo Hayes and Ricky Saints will once again collide when SmackDown comes to in Bologna, Italy.",
                "still_image": "",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 3554517,
                "id": 1398,
                "watched": true,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 27,
                "episode_number": 22,
                "title": "#1395 - Olimpic Arena in Barcelona, Spain",
                "air_date": "2026-05-29",
                "airtime": "06:00",
                "air_datetime": "2026-05-30T00:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Cody Rhodes will address Gunther's attack last week on SmackDown, as The American Nightmare prepares to defend the Undisputed WWE Championship against The Ring General in a highly-anticipated showdown at WWE Clash in Italy this Sunday.After pinning Rhea Ripley at Saturday Night's Main Event, Jade Cargill has a final message for The Eradicator just two days before they collide for the WWE Women's Championship at WWE Clash in Italy! Brace yourself for The Storm.Axiom is set to go one-on-one with The Miz after The A-Lister and Kit Wilson got into a backstage altercation with Fraxiom last week on SmackDown. Will Danhausen's \"curse\" continue to plague The A-Lister when he looks to defeat Axiom in his home country of Spain?\u00a0After Rickey Saints cost Carmelo Hayes his match against United States Champion Trick Williams last week, the two Superstars will once again go one-on-one.",
                "still_image": "",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 3554516,
                "id": 1397,
                "watched": true,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 27,
                "episode_number": 21,
                "title": "#1394 - Rupp Arena in Lexington, KY",
                "air_date": "2026-05-22",
                "airtime": "06:00",
                "air_datetime": "2026-05-23T00:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "How will Gunther respond one week before challenging The American Nightmare for the title at WWE Clash in Italy?WWE Women's Champion Rhea Ripley is set to kick off SmackDown\u00a0tonight to answer Jade Cargill's challenge for a rematch for the title at WWE Clash in Italy. Brace yourself for The Eradicator, tonight.Tiffany Stratton will issue a Women's United States Championship Open Challenge. Who will step into the spotlight to attempt to stop Tiffy Time?After returning to SmackDown to defeat Ricky Saints last week, Carmelo Hayes has a message for United States Champion Trick Williams and Lil Yachty.Shinsuke Nakamura has been planting dissent in the mind of Tama Tonga for some time.\u00a0Tonight, The Artist will go one-on-one with the dangerous Tonga.",
                "still_image": "",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 3554515,
                "id": 1396,
                "watched": true,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 27,
                "episode_number": 20,
                "title": "#1393 - Colonial Life Arena in Columbia, SC",
                "air_date": "2026-05-15",
                "airtime": "06:00",
                "air_datetime": "2026-05-16T00:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Will Gunther, however, officially move to SmackDown\u00a0in order to challenge The American Nightmare.After successfully defending the United States Championship against Sami Zayn at WWE Backlash, Trick Williams will walk back into the University of South Carolina in his lemon pepper steppers for a special homecoming celebration.",
                "still_image": "",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 3554514,
                "id": 1395,
                "watched": true,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 27,
                "episode_number": 19,
                "title": "#1392 - VyStar Veterans Memorial Arena in Jacksonville, FL",
                "air_date": "2026-05-08",
                "airtime": "06:00",
                "air_datetime": "2026-05-09T00:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Fatu is set to kick off SmackDown on Friday, one night before he challenges Reigns for the World Heavyweight Championship at WWE Backlash.\u00a0Find out what bedlam will be unleashed.After a unleashing a surprise attack on Undisputed WWE Champion Cody Rhodes last week, Gunther will address the WWE Universe.\u00a0Trick Williams will host a funeral for the Gingerbread Man one night before defending the United States Championship against Sami Zayn at WWE Backlash.WWE Women's Champion Rhea Ripley will stand united with Charlotte Flair and Alexa Bliss to attempt to quell the rising threat of Fatal Influence in a Six-Woman Tag Team Match.Stratton goes one-on-one against Kiana James in a showdown for the gold.Priest will be out for payback when he undertakes the monstrous task of battling Tonga one-on-one.",
                "still_image": "",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 3554513,
                "id": 1394,
                "watched": true,
                "notify": "seen"
            }
