                "airtime": "22:05",
                "air_datetime": "2015-11-03T16:05:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Saitama and Genos find out about the hero registration and both take the tests to certify. Genos gets \"S(Special)\" and Saitama gets a \"C\" grade. Meanwhile, Genos became the disciple of Saitama and learned about the power of saitama's punch on a training session.",
