                "airtime": "19:00",
                "air_datetime": "2016-03-10T13:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Yoo Si Jin returns to Korea to attend his father's retirement celebration from the Army. The medical team have packed their stuff and is ready to leave, when suddenly an earthquake changes their entire plan.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/48/120391.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 627680,
                "id": 6,
