                "air_date": "2016-03-03",
                "airtime": "19:00",
                "air_datetime": "2016-03-03T13:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Yoo Si jin tells Mo Yeon to operate her patient and commands his team to protect them, even when this means to disobey a direct order from above. While it's still unknown whether their patient will recover, Yoo Si Jin will face the consequences for his disobedience.",
