                "airtime": "19:00",
                "air_datetime": "2016-03-02T13:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "The medical team settled down and is ready to take blood samples from soldiers, when a truck crashes in a mountain pass nearby their base. However this crash is more complicated than they initially thought.",
