                "air_datetime": "2016-02-25T13:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Yoo Si Jin returns after being deployed to Afghanistan and meet up with Kang Mo-Yeon during his two free weeks before being deployed to Urk for eight months. Kang Mo-Yeon tells him that her vision of life is completely different than that of Yoo Si Jin and therefore she can't be together with him.",
