                "overview": "After giving first aid to a thief they just tackled, Seo Dae-Young and Yoo Shi Jin discover that Seo Dae-Young's phone has been stolen. Their search for his mobile leads them to Haesung Hospital where they bump into Doctor Kang Mo Yun, which is distrustful to their intentions.",
