            },
            {
                "season_number": 5,
                "episode_number": 9,
                "title": "Vesta | Altar of the Sacred Flame",
                "air_date": "2024-12-05",
                "airtime": "21:30",
                "air_datetime": "2024-12-05T15:30:00+00:00",
                "overview": "As Bell discovers the truth about Syr and confronts Freya, Hestia unleashes her power. She is the Goddess of the Hearth, which makes her the most formidable deity in Orario.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/546/1366340.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 3019886,
                "id": 68,
                "watched": false,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 5,
                "episode_number": 8,
                "title": "Bell Cranel | Desires",
                "air_date": "2024-11-21",
                "airtime": "21:30",
                "air_datetime": "2024-11-21T15:30:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Everyone has a breaking point, and Bell is approaching his limit. He has two choices left: he can either give in and accept Freya's affections, or forge ahead as his true self.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/544/1362090.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 3019885,
                "id": 67,
                "watched": false,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 5,
                "episode_number": 7,
                "title": "Loneliness | Separated",
                "air_date": "2024-11-14",
                "airtime": "21:30",
                "air_datetime": "2024-11-14T15:30:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Freya's control was never absolute. There will always be those who slipped through the cracks and cannot accept the new status quo.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/543/1359639.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 3019884,
                "id": 66,
                "watched": false,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 5,
                "episode_number": 6,
                "title": "Orario | Distorted City",
                "air_date": "2024-11-07",
                "airtime": "21:30",
                "air_datetime": "2024-11-07T15:30:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Bell claims he's part of the Hestia Familia. But that can't be right, he's always been part of the Freya Familia. His own Familia and goddess wouldn't lie to him, right?",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/542/1357038.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 3019883,
                "id": 65,
                "watched": false,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 5,
                "episode_number": 5,
                "title": "Freya Familia | Invasion",
                "air_date": "2024-10-31",
                "airtime": "21:30",
                "air_datetime": "2024-10-31T15:30:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Syr had her chance. It's Freya's turn now, and the goddess will use any means necessary to make all of Orario understand that Bell is hers. Completely. Undeniably. Hers.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/541/1354272.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 3019882,
                "id": 64,
                "watched": false,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 5,
                "episode_number": 4,
                "title": "Seidr | God and Girl",
                "air_date": "2024-10-24",
                "airtime": "21:30",
                "air_datetime": "2024-10-24T15:30:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Bell can't act the dense, indecisive fool\u2014not after Syr poured her heart out to him. He must respond to her feelings honestly, but now the Freya Familia is trying to kill her",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/541/1354273.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 3019881,
                "id": 63,
                "watched": false,
