                "air_date": "2023-10-19",
                "airtime": "20:56",
                "air_datetime": "2023-10-19T14:56:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Yuji makes his way to Shibuya Station where he's confronted by Choso. Choso unleashes his Convergence and the battle between him and Yuji commences.",
