                "airtime": "22:25",
                "air_datetime": "2020-11-06T16:25:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Gojo stews in his frustration over Itadori's death. Both Fushiguro and Nobara are depressed by their teammate's death, but they begin their special training with the second year students to get stronger. Meanwhile, Geto and the others begin to make their move. And during all of that, the dead Itadori...",
