                "airtime": "18:00",
                "air_datetime": "2022-12-22T12:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "With only a few minutes left in the game, the results for each team seems fixed. Arisu approaches Kyuma, and asks to shake his hand.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/436/1090789.jpg",
