                "air_date": "2021-06-28",
                "airtime": "22:30",
                "air_datetime": "2021-06-28T16:30:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Just as Gugu and Rean come to understand each other, the Nokkers emerge, causing panic in the party hall. Fushi and Gugu are forced to fight.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/653/1634479.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 2030069,
                "id": 12,
                "watched": true,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 1,
                "episode_number": 11,
                "title": "Gift From the Past",
                "air_date": "2021-06-21",
                "airtime": "22:30",
                "air_datetime": "2021-06-21T16:30:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Four years after their encounter with the Nokkers, Fushi and Gugu have grown into fine young men. They're invited to Rean's birthday party after a brief reunion with Gugu's brother.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/653/1634478.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 2030068,
                "id": 11,
                "watched": true,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 1,
                "episode_number": 10,
                "title": "New Family",
                "air_date": "2021-06-14",
                "airtime": "22:30",
                "air_datetime": "2021-06-14T16:30:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Fushi and Gugu fight against the Nokkers that they encountered in the forest. Though the situation is grim, Gugu has a trick up his sleeve.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/653/1634477.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 2030067,
                "id": 10,
                "watched": true,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 1,
                "episode_number": 9,
                "title": "Deep Memories",
                "air_date": "2021-06-07",
                "airtime": "22:30",
                "air_datetime": "2021-06-07T16:30:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Fushi tells Gugu about the wolf, Joaan, and the boy he took on the form of. Gugu explains death to Fushi, recalling his own past, working for a wealthy family with his brother.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/653/1634476.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 2030066,
                "id": 9,
                "watched": true,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 1,
                "episode_number": 8,
                "title": "The Two Monsters",
                "air_date": "2021-05-31",
                "airtime": "22:30",
                "air_datetime": "2021-05-31T16:30:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Fushi explains to Gugu how his form as the wolf, Joaan, and March, came to be. Gugu explains death to Fushi. Together, they come to understand the meaning of family.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/653/1634475.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 2030065,
                "id": 8,
                "watched": true,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 1,
                "episode_number": 7,
                "title": "The Boy Who Wants To Change",
                "air_date": "2021-05-24",
                "airtime": "22:30",
                "air_datetime": "2021-05-24T16:30:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Fushi and Pioran arrive at Takunaha, where they meet Booze Man and a boy named Gugu. Gugu, who had been living with Booze Man for several months following an accident, warms up to Fushi.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/653/1634473.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 2030064,
                "id": 7,
                "watched": true,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
