    {
        "id": 120,
        "tmdb_id": 42942,
        "external_ids": {
            "tmdb": 42942
        },
        "title": "Angel Beats!",
        "year": "2010",
        "overview": "Angel Beats takes place in the afterlife and focuses on Otonashi, a boy who lost his memories of his life after dying. He is enrolled into the afterlife school and meets a girl named Yuri who invites him to join the Afterlife Battlefront \u2014 an organization she leads which fights against God. The Battlefront fight against the student council president Angel, a girl with supernatural powers.",
        "cover_image": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ld5fQq1PltjjLbWVww6KBV79DLt.jpg",
        "directory_path": "",
        "genres": [
            "Animation",
            "Comedy",
            "Drama",
            "Sci-Fi & Fantasy",
            "Action & Adventure"
        ],
        "rating": 4,
        "tmdb_rating": 7.9,
        "status": "Ended",
        "episodes": [
            {
                "season_number": 1,
                "episode_number": 13,
                "title": "Graduation",
                "air_date": "2010-06-25",
                "airtime": "11:00",
                "air_datetime": "2010-06-25T05:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "When she awakens from her dangerous solo mission, Yuri finds her surviving friends in Battlefront seem to have found peace. In an impromptu \"graduation\" ceremony, they all take steps to move on to the next level of existence. But this transition seems most difficult for Otonashi, as it means losing his newly formed bond with Angel.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/77/194220.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 309885,
                "id": 13,
                "watched": false,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 1,
                "episode_number": 12,
                "title": "Knockin' on Heaven's Door",
                "air_date": "2010-06-18",
                "airtime": "11:00",
                "air_datetime": "2010-06-18T05:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "The Shadow monsters show no signs of stopping as more Battlefront members and NPCs fall victim to their strange, marauding power. Yuri takes a dangerous trip into the darkened Guild. In her search to find out just who\u2014or what\u2014is behind these new events, she discovers even darker secrets about herself.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/75/188693.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 309884,
                "id": 12,
                "watched": false,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 1,
                "episode_number": 11,
                "title": "Change the World",
                "air_date": "2010-06-11",
                "airtime": "11:00",
                "air_datetime": "2010-06-11T05:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "As Hinata and Otonashi talk with Naoi, something strange happens: his shadow takes an enormous, evil form and engulf him. Weapons are powerless to stop the creature. Making matters worse, the Shadow monsters are multiplying and taking control of the members of Battlefront and the NPCs.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/75/188595.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 309883,
                "id": 11,
                "watched": false,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 1,
                "episode_number": 10,
                "title": "Goodbye Days",
                "air_date": "2010-06-04",
                "airtime": "11:00",
                "air_datetime": "2010-06-04T05:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Otonashi decides that the high-strung singer, Yui, needs to be pushed into finding peace and \"moving on.\" To do so, he enlists Angel who shows him her new weapon: the dark and evil-looking Hand Sonic 5. But Yui has other plans\u2014namely to beat the boys of Battlefront in a violent game on the soccer field.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/75/188574.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 309882,
                "id": 10,
                "watched": false,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 1,
                "episode_number": 9,
                "title": "In Your Memory",
                "air_date": "2010-05-28",
                "airtime": "11:00",
                "air_datetime": "2010-05-28T05:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "With the Angel clone situation becoming uncontrollable, Naoi proposes that they once again call upon the genius hacker, Christ. Meanwhile, Otonashi begins to remember his past.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/75/188525.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 309881,
                "id": 9,
                "watched": false,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 1,
                "episode_number": 8,
                "title": "Dancer in the Dark",
                "air_date": "2010-05-21",
                "airtime": "11:00",
                "air_datetime": "2010-05-21T05:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "With Otonashi's and Angel's newly formed alliance, dark and powerful clones of Angel have begun attacking the Battlefront with greater aggression. They must return to the trap-rigged Guild once more and risk heartbreaking, violent losses.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/75/188510.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 309880,
                "id": 8,
                "watched": false,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 1,
                "episode_number": 7,
                "title": "Alive",
                "air_date": "2010-05-14",
                "airtime": "11:00",
                "air_datetime": "2010-05-14T05:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Now that Naoi has seemingly joined Battlefront, Yui persuades Otonashi to let his powers of hypnosis help him recover his memories. But Otonashi may not be ready to remember such a tragic, painful past. But there are other issues at hand for the group\u2014such as banding together to capture the mysterious creature from a nearby river known only as the Monster Stream.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/74/187332.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 309879,
                "id": 7,
                "watched": false,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 1,
                "episode_number": 6,
