                "airtime": "11:00",
                "air_datetime": "2010-05-01T05:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "To strip Angel of her scholastic power, Yui devises a plan for the Battlefront to replace Angel's test results with bogus ones. She will be shamed, stripped of her title of Student Body President, and be out of their way for good. But they never realize the one who replaces her may be even more sinister than Angel could ever be.",
