                "airtime": "11:00",
                "air_datetime": "2010-04-10T05:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Realizing they need more weapons in their battle against Angel, the group descends into the Guild. But once there, they realize that all of the hallways, staircases, and passageways have been rigged with deadly traps. It's a race against time to see if they can get through the violent maze before Angel catches up with them.",
