                "air_date": "2020-01-14",
                "airtime": "07:00",
                "air_datetime": "2020-01-15T01:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Stuck in the Vanishing Point, the Paragons search for a way to escape. The futility of the situation is compounded by The Flash's disappearance. However, hope appears in the form of Oliver, who reveals that he has become something else. Meanwhile, the origin stories for The Monitor and Anti-Monitor are revealed.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/236/590462.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 1745512,
                "id": 168,
