                "air_datetime": "2019-11-27T02:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Oliver and Laurel find themselves in a time loop from the past where Quentin is still alive... and each time the loop resets with his death. The two heroes try to find a way to break the loop and determine what's going on.",
