                "air_datetime": "2019-11-20T02:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Oliver, Laurel, Mia, and William travel to Russia to get the plans for a weapon capable of stopping the monitor, and Oliver faces reminders of his past with the Bratva. Meanwhile, Diggle recruits an ally to help him steal the plutonium for the weapon.",
