                "airtime": "06:00",
                "air_datetime": "2015-04-23T00:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Ra's al Ghul finally makes Oliver an offer he can't refuse. The team joins Oliver on his journey to Nanda Parbat where a heartbroken Felicity decides to take matters into her own hands.",
