            },
            {
                "season_number": 1,
                "episode_number": 23,
                "title": "Sacrifice",
                "air_date": "2013-05-15",
                "airtime": "06:00",
                "air_datetime": "2013-05-16T00:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Oliver and Diggle race to stop the Dark Archer from unleashing his vengeance on The Glades. However, they run into a roadblock after Detective Lance picks up Felicity for questioning. Tommy and Oliver's already tumultuous relationship takes a turn for the worse after Oliver makes a confession about Laurel. After hearing of the danger in The Glades, Thea races to find Roy, inadvertently putting herself directly in the line of fire for Malcolm's devious plan. On the island, Oliver, Slade and Shado are locked in a life-or-death struggle against Fyers as his missiles lock on a full Ferris Air jetliner.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/86/215828.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 135,
                "id": 23,
                "watched": false,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 1,
                "episode_number": 22,
                "title": "Darkness on the Edge of Town",
                "air_date": "2013-05-08",
                "airtime": "06:00",
                "air_datetime": "2013-05-09T00:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "With the Undertaking days away, Malcolm dons his black hood to conclude business with seismologist Dr. Brion Markov and his team. Oliver and Moira entertain a number of surprise - and mostly unwelcome - visitors. Hooded confrontations at home and the Meryln Global Group reveal dark secrets. Meanwhile, Roy and Thea are still looking out for a hero. Laurel makes a decision after Tommy's revelation. In a flashback to the island, Oliver, Slade and Shado struggle to prevent Fyers from shooting a Ferris Air jet out of the sky.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/86/215788.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 134,
                "id": 22,
                "watched": false,
