        "title": "Avatar: The Last Airbender",
        "year": "2005",
        "overview": "In a war-torn world of elemental magic, a young boy reawakens to undertake a dangerous mystic quest to fulfill his destiny as the Avatar, and bring peace to the world.",
        "cover_image": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yaGt4GIutpbXHsv48tWceWg6s56.jpg",
        "directory_path": "",
        "genres": [
            "Animation",
            "Action & Adventure",
            "Sci-Fi & Fantasy"
        ],
        "rating": 4,
        "tmdb_rating": 8.8,
        "status": "Ended",
        "episodes": [
            {
                "season_number": 3,
                "episode_number": 21,
                "title": "Book Three: Fire - Chapter Twenty One: Sozin's Comet, Part 4: Avatar Aang",
                "air_date": "2008-07-19",
                "airtime": "06:30",
                "air_datetime": "2008-07-20T00:30:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Aang's moment of truth arrives. Can he defeat Ozai, the Phoenix King? Will he be forced to take a human life? All the characters face their greatest challenges.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/201/502915.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 51776,
                "id": 61,
                "watched": true,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 3,
                "episode_number": 20,
                "title": "Book Three: Fire - Chapter Twenty: Sozin's Comet, Part 3: Into the Inferno",
                "air_date": "2008-07-19",
                "airtime": "06:30",
                "air_datetime": "2008-07-20T00:30:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Zuko battles his sister with Katara's help for the right to be named Fire Lord. Elsewhere, Aang meets Ozai just as the comet arrives.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/201/502909.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 51775,
                "id": 60,
                "watched": true,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 3,
                "episode_number": 19,
                "title": "Book Three: Fire - Chapter Nineteen: Sozin's Comet, Part 2: The Old Masters",
                "air_date": "2008-07-19",
                "airtime": "06:30",
                "air_datetime": "2008-07-20T00:30:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Aang awakes on a mysterious island and confronts his past lives for advice on how to stop the Fire Lord without killing him. The rest of the group searches for Aang.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/201/502906.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 51774,
                "id": 59,
                "watched": true,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 3,
                "episode_number": 18,
                "title": "Book Three: Fire - Chapter Eighteen: Sozin's Comet, Part 1: The Phoenix King",
                "air_date": "2008-07-19",
                "airtime": "06:30",
                "air_datetime": "2008-07-20T00:30:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Sozin's Comet is only three days away. Zuko tells the others what the Fire Lord plans on the day of the comet and the gang realizes that they must stop him before then. But Aang doubts that he can do what is expected of him.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/201/502903.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 51773,
                "id": 58,
                "watched": true,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 3,
                "episode_number": 17,
                "title": "Book Three: Fire - Chapter Seventeen: The Ember Island Players",
                "air_date": "2008-07-18",
                "airtime": "06:30",
                "air_datetime": "2008-07-19T00:30:00+00:00",
                "overview": "With only a few days until the arrive of Sozin's Comet, the gang decides to stay at Zuko's family's summer home on Ember Island. They find out that there is a play about them and all their past adventures, and decide to atttend. Meanwhile, Aang tells Katara how he feels about her, but the response is ambiguous.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/201/502896.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 51772,
                "id": 57,
                "watched": true,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 3,
                "episode_number": 16,
                "title": "Book Three: Fire - Chapter Sixteen: The Southern Raiders",
                "air_date": "2008-07-17",
                "airtime": "06:30",
                "air_datetime": "2008-07-18T00:30:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Azula attacks the Western Air Temple, forcing everyone to flee. At the next campground, Zuko asks Sokka about the day his and Katara's mom was killed. He reveals that he knows who killed their mother. He tells Katara, and the two set out to find him. But will Katara be able to keep her cool when she meets him or will she go too far",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/201/502893.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 51771,
                "id": 56,
                "watched": true,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 3,
                "episode_number": 15,
                "title": "Book Three: Fire - Chapter Fifteen: The Boiling Rock, Part 2",
                "air_date": "2008-07-16",
                "airtime": "06:30",
                "air_datetime": "2008-07-17T00:30:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Sokka has found his father, but with one escape plan failure, he doesn't know if there's another way off the island. Luckily, with his father, Suki, and Chit Sang at his side their new plan soon comes together, but will they be able to execute if before Azula arrives? Meanwhile, Mai arrives at the prison and confronts Zuko about what happened on the day of the invasion.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/201/502888.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 51770,
                "id": 55,
                "watched": true,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 3,
                "episode_number": 14,
                "title": "Book Three: Fire - Chapter Fourteen: The Boiling Rock, Part 1",
                "air_date": "2008-07-16",
                "airtime": "06:30",
                "air_datetime": "2008-07-17T00:30:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Sokka is haunted by the decisions he made during the invasion plan, and feels the need to regain his honor. With the help of Zuko, Sokka travels to the highest security prison in the Fire Nation, The Boiling Rock. Disguised as guards, they search the prison, until one of them is revealed. With time running out, Sokka needs to decide if he should cut his losses and leave, or try to finish what he started.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/201/502885.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 51769,
                "id": 54,
                "watched": true,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 3,
                "episode_number": 13,
                "title": "Book Three: Fire - Chapter Thirteen: The Firebending Masters",
                "air_date": "2008-07-15",
                "airtime": "06:30",
                "air_datetime": "2008-07-16T00:30:00+00:00",
                "overview": "While teaching Aang Firebending, Zuko finds that he has lost all of his Firebending skills. Now, to regain his powers, Zuko and Aang must seek the original source of Firebending within the ruins of a lost civilization.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/162/407258.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 51768,
                "id": 53,
                "watched": true,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 3,
                "episode_number": 12,
                "title": "Book Three: Fire - Chapter Twelve: The Western Air Temple",
                "air_date": "2008-07-14",
                "airtime": "06:30",
                "air_datetime": "2008-07-15T00:30:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Aang and his group finally arrive at the Western Air Temple. There, they meet a repented Zuko, who offers to join their ranks. But acceptance of their former enemy's intention is not in their plans. Zuko has a hard time trying to earn everyone's trust, however, another unexpected encounter might change his chances.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/162/407254.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 51767,
                "id": 52,
                "watched": true,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 3,
                "episode_number": 11,
                "title": "Book Three: Fire - Chapter Eleven: The Day of Black Sun, Part 2: The Eclipse",
                "air_date": "2007-11-30",
                "airtime": "07:30",
                "air_datetime": "2007-12-01T01:30:00+00:00",
                "overview": "As the invasion force fights their way to the Fire Nation capital, the kids help Aang to find the Fire Lord in time for the eclipse, but there are a few surprises waiting ahead. Will Aang finally complete his mission or will he lose the battle against the forces of the Fire Nation?",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/201/502874.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 51766,
                "id": 51,
                "watched": true,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 3,
                "episode_number": 10,
                "title": "Book Three: Fire - Chapter Ten: The Day of Black Sun, Part 1: The Invasion",
                "air_date": "2007-11-30",
                "airtime": "07:30",
                "air_datetime": "2007-12-01T01:30:00+00:00",
                "overview": "The day of the eclipse has arrived, and the invasion force gathers together to make last preparations. As the eclipse draws near, they launch their assault on the Fire Nation Capital and begin their long struggle with the Fire Nation Army. Will they be able to survive the battle with the Fire Nation? Meanwhile, Aang enters the Royal Palace and searches for Fire Lord Ozai.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/200/502491.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 51765,
                "id": 50,
                "watched": true,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 3,
                "episode_number": 9,
                "title": "Book Three: Fire - Chapter Nine: Nightmares and Daydreams",
                "air_date": "2007-11-16",
                "airtime": "07:30",
                "air_datetime": "2007-11-17T01:30:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Four days prior the invasion, Aang becomes nervous over his soon-to-come confrontation with the Fire Lord. His anxiety gets the better of him as he begins to suffer from outrageous nightmares and hallucinations. Meanwhile, Zuko becomes upset to learn that he was not informed about a war meeting.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/200/502486.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 51764,
                "id": 49,
                "watched": true,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 3,
                "episode_number": 8,
                "title": "Book Three: Fire - Chapter Eighth: The Puppetmaster",
                "air_date": "2007-11-09",
                "airtime": "07:30",
                "air_datetime": "2007-11-10T01:30:00+00:00",
                "overview": "The gang meet a waterbender who lives in the Fire Nation after being captured years ago. Katara becomes her pupil to further develop her waterbending, while Aang, Sokka, and Toph discover she might be connected to a bunch of disappearances. So can this mysterious waterbender be trusted?",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/200/502481.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 51763,
                "id": 48,
                "watched": true,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 3,
                "episode_number": 7,
                "title": "Book Three: Fire - Chapter Seven: The Runaway",
                "air_date": "2007-11-02",
                "airtime": "06:30",
                "air_datetime": "2007-11-03T00:30:00+00:00",
                "overview": "When Katara expresses her disapproval to Toph's new way to make quick cash, the group finds her too motherly, and tension grows between Katara and Toph. When Katara finally decides to participate in this scam to disprove Toph's accusations, the gang is left vulnerable and are forced to face dire consequences.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/200/502478.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 51762,
                "id": 47,
                "watched": true,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 3,
                "episode_number": 6,
                "title": "Book Three: Fire - Chapter Six: The Avatar and the Firelord",
                "air_date": "2007-10-26",
                "airtime": "06:30",
                "air_datetime": "2007-10-27T00:30:00+00:00",
                "overview": "The tale of Avatar Roku and Fire Lord Sozin is revealed to Aang and Zuko by different sources. Both learn about themselves and are shown the origins of the war. But will Zuko and Aang learn anything from this?",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/200/502474.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 51761,
                "id": 46,
                "watched": true,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 3,
                "episode_number": 5,
                "title": "Book Three: Fire - Chapter Five: The Beach",
                "air_date": "2007-10-19",
                "airtime": "06:30",
                "air_datetime": "2007-10-20T00:30:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Zuko, Azula, Mai, and Ty Lee take a vacation to Ember Island. In the process, they come to learn more about themselves and each other, as well as their desires for the future. Arguments rise and fall. Will the group learn to become friends and trust each other? Elsewhere, Aang and others face off against a new adversary. What will this lead to?",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/200/502468.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 51760,
