                "air_date": "2007-09-21",
                "airtime": "06:30",
                "air_datetime": "2007-09-22T00:30:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Aang awakens to find himself aboard a captured Fire Nation ship with a full head of hair and with serious injuries from the battle in Ba Sing Se. At his side are Toph, Katara, Sokka, and their father Hakoda who recount the events that led the four to the ship and together they contemplate their next move. Aang struggles with the fact that the world thinks he is dead and his own desire to face the Fire Lord before he is ready. Meanwhile, the once exiled Prince Zuko deals with his own issues as he makes his long-awaited journey back to the Fire Nation, and wonders what is now in store for him.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/200/502451.jpg",
