                "airtime": "06:30",
                "air_datetime": "2006-04-29T00:30:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Aang and the gang discover an Earth Kingdom town that celebrates something called \"Avatar Day.\" But when they get there and learn the festival is of \"anti-Avatar\" sentiment and Aang is put on trial for a crime a past incarnation allegedly committed. Looking to clear the Avatar's good name, Katara and Sokka venture back to a familiar place to gather evidence and discover the truth. Can Aang redeem himself in the eyes of the people of the town?",
