                "air_datetime": "2006-03-25T01:30:00+00:00",
                "overview": "On their way to Omashu, Aang, Katara, and Sokka meet a group of nomads who show them a shortcut through the \"Cave of Two Lovers.\" But when the group becomes trapped in the cave, it's up to Aang and Katara to save the group by trusting in love and possibly questioning their relationship. Meanwhile Iroh gets a lethal rash so Zuko and Iroh head to a small Earth Kingdom town for help, hoping their real identities will not be discovered.",
