                "air_datetime": "2013-02-09T03:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "A band of marauding bikers crashes the annual Banshee Spirit Festival, with deadly consequences, sparking Lucas and Siobhan to mete out vigilante justice. Burned after losing his key witness against Proctor, Lucas is further dismayed when FBI agent Xavier arrives to monitor the situation. Rebecca Bowman, torn between passion and her Amish roots, finds a kindred spirit in the sheriff.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/402/1005120.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 11750,
                "id": 5,
                "watched": true,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 1,
                "episode_number": 4,
                "title": "Half Deaf Is Better Than All Dead",
                "air_date": "2013-02-01",
                "airtime": "09:00",
                "air_datetime": "2013-02-02T03:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Botched museum heist in Harrisburg has unintended consequences, as Lucas, Carrie and Job renew their partnership, at least for the moment. Later, after coercing redneck henchman Arno to offer up incriminating evidence, Lucas and Emmett arrest Proctor for Hanson's murder, but are detoured on the way to the jail. Sugar looks for a cut; Kendall gets roughed up; Lucas and Carrie love the ones they're with.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/402/1005119.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 11749,
                "id": 4,
                "watched": true,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 1,
                "episode_number": 3,
                "title": "Meet the New Boss",
                "air_date": "2013-01-25",
                "airtime": "09:00",
                "air_datetime": "2013-01-26T03:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "A mixed martial arts title bout is being planned at the Kinaho Moon Casino, run by tribe leader Benjamin Longshadow and his son Alex. Huge profits are anticipated for Banshee investors, but the enterprise is threatened when the champion arrives and angers Lucas and especially Siobhan. Will Lucas keep his mouth shut and allow the fight to go on as planned?",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/402/1005118.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 11748,
                "id": 3,
                "watched": true,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 1,
                "episode_number": 2,
                "title": "The Rave",
                "air_date": "2013-01-18",
                "airtime": "09:00",
                "air_datetime": "2013-01-19T03:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Hanson, a desperate underling of Proctor, holds a rave in an Amish barn, selling homemade E pills stolen from his boss to Banshee youth, including Deva, Carrie's rebellious daughter. Catching wind of the plan, Lucas and his team orchestrate a raid, but the effects of a tainted batch of pills send many revelers into convulsions, with one notable fatality. Though Deva is ferried home safely by Lucas, Hanson isn't as fortunate when he returns to Kai's mansion following the debacle.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/402/1005117.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 11747,
                "id": 2,
                "watched": true,
                "notify": "seen"
            },
            {
                "season_number": 1,
                "episode_number": 1,
                "title": "Pilot",
                "air_date": "2013-01-11",
                "airtime": "09:00",
                "air_datetime": "2013-01-12T03:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "In a bizarre twist of fate, a recently paroled master thief assumes the identity of Lucas Hood, sheriff-in-waiting of Banshee, Pa., the same town where his former partner and lover, who changed her name to Carrie, relocated and remarried years ago. Keeping his history a secret as he awaits forged papers from Job, an unlikely New York City ally, Lucas befriends boxer-turned-bartender Sugar Bates, and settles into his new life as Banshee's sheriff,overseeing deputies Emmett Yawners, Siobahn Kelly and Brock Lotus.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/402/1005116.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 11746,
                "id": 1,
                "watched": true,
                "notify": "seen"
            }
        ],
