                "title": "Goodbye and Good Riddance",
                "air_date": "2008-04-15",
                "airtime": "22:00",
                "air_datetime": "2008-04-15T16:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "With summer over, Ben goes back to school. Unable to tell anyone about the Omnitrix, Ben finds that regular life is much more boring than he imagined. However, the arrival of Vilgax promises to rectify that situation.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/199/498934.jpg",
                "tvmaze_episode_id": 92292,
                "id": 49,
