                "title": "Ben 10 vs. Negative 10 (2)",
                "air_date": "2008-03-09",
                "airtime": "22:00",
                "air_datetime": "2008-03-09T16:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Ben, Gwen, Cooper and Grandpa Max face their last battle ever against the villains they have encountered and they will battle to get the world's most powerful energy source.",
