                "airtime": "22:00",
                "air_datetime": "2007-09-29T16:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "When Ben accidentally breaks Gwen's laptop, he participates in the \"Ultimate Wrestling Competition\" as Four Arms to get the prize money for a new laptop to replace Gwen's broken one.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/199/498909.jpg",
