                "overview": "Vanessa and her team are able to figure out how to leave Captain Dorothy's Glamour World due to quick thinking on Sally's part, but it's easier said than done. But then Luck gets an idea to help them out. Meanwhile, Asta continues to try to undo the reincarnation spell on Gauche and Marie but can't even get close to them. Henry sees this and decides to make a great sacrifice.",
