                "airtime": "15:25",
                "air_datetime": "2018-04-17T09:25:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Finral invites Asta and Luck to go to a mixer with him. Noelle hears about this and ends up following them because she's concerned about Asta. To deepen her cover, she even gets a job at the pub they go to.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/628/1571572.jpg",
