                "air_datetime": "2018-04-10T09:25:00+00:00",
                "overview": "The one who saved Asta from the group calling themselves the Eye of the Midnight Sun was the Wizard King, Julius, who was waiting for them at their base. Asta and the members of the Eye of the Midnight Sun are in awe of Julius's power.",
