                "airtime": "15:25",
                "air_datetime": "2018-03-13T09:25:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Thanks to Noelle's help, Asta is now able to concentrate on the battle. However, because of the attack he took earlier, Asta continues to lose stamina and isn't able to move as well as he'd like.",
