                "airtime": "15:25",
                "air_datetime": "2018-03-06T09:25:00+00:00",
                "overview": "After hearing about the attack on the capital, Asta rushed out, and the rest of the Magic Knights quickly followed. They found that corpses being controlled by Rades's wraith magic were attacking the citizens.",
