                "air_date": "2018-02-20",
                "airtime": "15:25",
                "air_datetime": "2018-02-20T09:25:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Asta and Noelle head to the Magic Knights Headquarters in the Noble Realm to report on their mission to capture the dungeon. On their way, they run into Yuno, Klaus, and Mimosa, and they all head to the headquarters together.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/627/1568179.jpg",
