                "air_date": "2018-02-06",
                "airtime": "15:25",
                "air_datetime": "2018-02-06T09:25:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Asta, Yuno and the others finally get to the treasure chamber, and they're in awe at the mountain of treasure in front t of them. Yuno finds a strange scroll with strange writing, and then his grimoire does something strange.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/627/1568161.jpg",
