                "airtime": "15:25",
                "air_datetime": "2018-01-30T09:25:00+00:00",
                "overview": "In order to go to the treasure chamber together with his friends, Yuno confronts Mars alongside Klaus, so that the injured Mimosa can heal herself. But they have a hard time harming Mars at all.",
