                "air_datetime": "2018-01-16T09:25:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Yuno, Klaus, and Mimosa from the Golden Dawn appear in front of Asta and Noelle, apparently sent on the same mission. Klaus mocks the Black Bulls for their awful reputation and gets in an argument with Asta.",
