                "air_datetime": "2017-12-26T09:25:00+00:00",
                "overview": "While on an escort mission, Yuno, Klaus and Mimosa are attacked by a mysterious group of men. Klaus senses that they're in danger and wants to escort Salim as quickly as possible, but Salim insists on visiting Yuno's hometown, Hage Village.",
