                "air_datetime": "2017-12-12T09:25:00+00:00",
                "overview": "After Asta, Magna, and Noelle saved the villagers of Saussy Village, the Wizard King gives the Black Bulls a star of honor. Asta and Noelle also receive their first pay as Magic Knights, and Asta is filled with happiness.",
