                "air_datetime": "2017-12-05T09:25:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Asta, Noelle, and Magna are doing their best to protect the villagers of Rayaka from the ice magic user Heath and his underlings, but Asta's attacks don't seem to be working, and Magna's magical powers are running low.",
