                "airtime": "15:25",
                "air_datetime": "2017-11-21T09:25:00+00:00",
                "overview": "The Magic Knights: heroes that everyone in the kingdom looks up to and dreams of becoming one day. But the new recruit, Asta, has yet to do anything that seems like what a Magic Knight should be doing, as he's stuck doing random chores.",
