                "air_datetime": "2006-06-24T14:30:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Rock is interrogated at the terrorist camp, and if he doesn't come clean about the documents, there's a good chance his captors will resort to torture. Revy's putting together a rescue mission - but time is running out.",
                "still_image": "",
