                "air_date": "2007-01-04",
                "airtime": "14:00",
                "air_datetime": "2007-01-04T08:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Impressed by the Black Knights' performance, the Kyoto suppliers seek council with them. If the meeting goes well, it could mean better resources and weapons. But when the leader demands to see Zero's face or no deal, will Lelouch make that sacrifice?",
