                "airtime": "14:00",
                "air_datetime": "2006-12-14T08:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "As the Black Knights grow in numbers they gain more resources and new weapons. Lelouch devises a plan to trap Cornelia when she stages an attack against the Japan Liberation Front in Narita. Will their new weapons prove their worth?",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/622/1555333.jpg",
