                "airtime": "14:00",
                "air_datetime": "2006-11-02T08:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "The mysterious green-haired girl known as C.C. is alive and intent on hanging around Lelouch as he accepted the contract and the Geass Power. Meanwhile, Suzaku is set free and encounters a strange girl who calls herself Euphie.",
