                "air_datetime": "2007-03-15T08:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Instead of getting time to work on his coup d'\u00e9tat, Lelouch is stuck working the school festival with the student council. Things get chaotic when the event attracts everyone, including Britannian soldiers and Euphemia, who makes a startling announcement.",
                "still_image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/291/727541.jpg",
