                "airtime": "14:00",
                "air_datetime": "2007-02-22T08:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Suzaku is appointed to be the princess' royal knight, leaving Lelouch to struggle with the decision of what to do about him. He wants Suzaku on his side, but will using the Geass on another loved one be the choice he has to make?",
