                "airtime": "14:00",
                "air_datetime": "2007-02-08T08:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Lelouch has the chance to gain more allies: Tohdoh from the J.L.F. and more importantly, Suzaku. But when Lelouch learns the truth behind the pilot of the white Knightmare, his plans could fall to pieces.",
