                "air_datetime": "2007-01-18T08:00:00+00:00",
                "overview": "Lelouch has to figure out who saw him before his identity is revealed to others, but when it turns out to be someone close to him, is he prepared for the consequences? When a second Geass user shows up, his situation becomes even more complicated.",
